{"id":"n24512-1-8","stage":2,"title":"구성 · 构成","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24512-1-8-1","ko":"가족 구성이 어떻게 됩니까?","zh":"您家里有哪些人？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가족","meaning":"家庭，家人","explanation":"가족：家庭，家人","readings":[{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44487","senseId":"1","lemma":"가족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}},{"text":"구성이","meaning":"构成","explanation":"구성：构成；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"구성","audio":"/audio/1d8936275d565bb0634c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24512","senseId":"1","lemma":"구성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구성이","audio":"/audio/c06fe85a39cd42d5c7aa.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"됩니까?","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"5","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됩니까","audio":"/audio/571187496de842dc35bb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7659575fd72a872b","term":"가족","zh":"家庭，家人","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3","entryId":"44487","definition":"主要指聚在一起生活，由婚姻、父母、子女、兄弟等的关系构成的社会单位；或指其成员。","pronunciation":["가족"]},{"id":"1d8936275d565bb0","term":"구성","zh":"构成","audio":"/audio/1d8936275d565bb0634c.mp3","entryId":"24512","definition":"凑集几个不可或缺之人或部分、要素，形成一个整体；或指那样形成的。","pronunciation":["구성"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、